{"seq":3,"slug":"gradient-attribution","title":"梯度归因与显著图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/feature-attribution/gradient-attribution","wordCount":1683,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"梯度归因与显著图\">梯度归因与显著图</h1><p><a href=\"lime-surrogate\">LIME</a> 和 <a href=\"shap-shapley\">SHAP</a> 都把模型当黑箱，靠成百上千次查询去估计重要度。但如果模型是一个可微的神经网络，我们手上其实握着一件黑箱方法没有的利器——反向传播。一次前向加一次反向，就能算出输出对每个输入像素的偏导数，几乎零额外成本地得到一张「哪些像素动一动最影响判断」的显著图。这是梯度归因的全部出发点：用模型自身的可微性，把归因变成一次求导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>梯度归因是一族方法的统称，它们共享同一套基础词汇。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>显著图（saliency map）</strong>：把输出对每个输入的偏导数（绝对值）画成的热力图，高亮「动一动最影响判断」的输入区域。</li>\n<li><strong>饱和（saturation）</strong>：当某特征已强到让激活函数进入平坦区，其梯度趋近于零，朴素梯度便会误判这个关键特征「不重要」。</li>\n<li><strong>基线（baseline）</strong>：积分路径的起点，如全黑图或模糊图。基线选择会显著影响归因结果，与删除/插入实验的基线依赖同源。</li>\n<li><strong>粒度的两极</strong>：像素级归因（朴素梯度、IG、SmoothGrad）细节丰富但细碎；区域级归因（Grad-CAM）语义连贯但粗糙。</li>\n<li><strong>敏感性 / 实现不变性</strong>：积分梯度满足的两条公理，前者要求改变预测的特征必须获得非零归因，后者要求功能等价的网络给出相同归因。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[可微神经网络] --&gt; B[一次前向 + 一次反向]&#10;  B --&gt; C[输出对输入的梯度]&#10;  C --&gt; D[像素级: 显著图]&#10;  C --&gt; E[区域级: 类激活图]&#10;  D --&gt; F[按公理或降噪改进]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  A[可微神经网络] --&gt; B[一次前向 + 一次反向]\n  B --&gt; C[输出对输入的梯度]\n  C --&gt; D[像素级: 显著图]\n  C --&gt; E[区域级: 类激活图]\n  D --&gt; F[按公理或降噪改进]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"朴素梯度-从求导到显著图\">朴素梯度：从求导到显著图</h2><p>最朴素的显著图（saliency map，2013 年提出）直接取输出类别得分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_i = \\left| \\frac{\\partial S_c}{\\partial x_i} \\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个输入维度的梯度绝对值就是它的重要度——梯度大，意味着该像素的微小变化会强烈改变类别得分。对图像，把每个像素的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 画成热力图，就是一张高亮「敏感区域」的显著图。它的迷人之处在于计算成本：与一次推理同量级，远快于 KernelSHAP 的反复采样。这把它牢牢钉在 <a href=\"../foundations/why-interpretability\">分类坐标系</a> 的「局部 + 模型相关 + 事后」格子里——模型相关，因为它要求模型可微、能反传梯度。</p>\n<p>但朴素梯度有两个致命弱点，催生了后续一整族改进方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[朴素梯度显著图] --&gt; B[问题一: 梯度饱和]&#10;  A --&gt; C[问题二: 视觉噪声]&#10;  B --&gt; D[积分梯度 IG]&#10;  C --&gt; E[SmoothGrad]&#10;  A --&gt; F[问题三: 像素级太细]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Grad-CAM 类激活映射]&#10;  D --&gt; H[更忠实的归因]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[朴素梯度显著图] --&gt; B[问题一: 梯度饱和]\n  A --&gt; C[问题二: 视觉噪声]\n  B --&gt; D[积分梯度 IG]\n  C --&gt; E[SmoothGrad]\n  A --&gt; F[问题三: 像素级太细]\n  F --&gt; G[Grad-CAM 类激活映射]\n  D --&gt; H[更忠实的归因]\n  E --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"梯度饱和与积分梯度\">梯度饱和与积分梯度</h2><p>第一个弱点是<strong>饱和</strong>。设想一个特征已经强到让 ReLU 或 sigmoid 完全饱和，此时再增大它，输出几乎不变，梯度趋近于零——朴素梯度会判定这个明明决定了结果的特征「不重要」。这违反了 <a href=\"../foundations/evaluating-explanations\">解释的评估</a> 里提到的敏感性公理。</p>\n<p>积分梯度（Integrated Gradients, IG）用一个优雅的办法绕开饱和：不看单点梯度，而是沿一条从基线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如全黑图）到真实输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的直线路径，把沿途的梯度积分起来。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IG_i(x) = (x_i - x_i&#x27;) \\times \\int_{\\alpha=0}^{1} \\frac{\\partial F(x&#x27; + \\alpha(x - x&#x27;))}{\\partial x_i}\\, d\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.476em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.564em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4289em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：哪怕终点处梯度饱和为零，路径早段（特征还小的时候）的梯度不为零，积分把这段贡献累加了进来。IG 的另一大优点是它满足两条公理——敏感性与实现不变性，并且其归因之和恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(x) - F(x&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这与 SHAP 的效率公理精神一致。实践中用黎曼和近似积分，路径上取几十个点即可。基线的选择（全黑、模糊、噪声）会显著影响结果，这点与 <a href=\"../foundations/evaluating-explanations\">删除/插入实验的基线依赖</a> 同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降噪与定位-smoothgrad-与-grad-cam\">降噪与定位：SmoothGrad 与 Grad-CAM</h2><p>第二个弱点是<strong>视觉噪声</strong>：朴素显著图常常布满高频噪点，因为梯度在局部剧烈波动。SmoothGrad 的解法简单粗暴却有效——给输入加多次小高斯噪声，对每个噪声版本算显著图再平均，随机噪点被平均掉，真正稳定的重要区域凸显出来。这本质是在做 <a href=\"../foundations/evaluating-explanations\">解释的评估</a> 里说的稳健性增强。</p>\n<p>第三个问题是像素级归因太细碎、缺乏语义。Grad-CAM 针对卷积网络换了个粒度：它不看输入像素，而看最后一个卷积层的特征图，用「类别得分对各特征图的梯度」做加权，得到一张粗糙但语义连贯的定位热力图，直接告诉你「网络在看图像的哪个物体区域」。它常与朴素梯度（细节）结合成 Guided Grad-CAM。下表对四种方法做横向对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素梯度</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>像素级</td>\n<td>饱和、噪声大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积分梯度 IG</td>\n<td>饱和、满足公理</td>\n<td>像素级</td>\n<td>需选基线、多次前向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SmoothGrad</td>\n<td>视觉噪声</td>\n<td>像素级</td>\n<td>多次采样、需调噪声方差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grad-CAM</td>\n<td>语义定位</td>\n<td>区域级（卷积层）</td>\n<td>依赖卷积结构、分辨率低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"忠实性争议与正确使用\">忠实性争议与正确使用</h2><p>梯度方法计算快、用得广，但忠实性争议也最大。<a href=\"../foundations/evaluating-explanations\">解释的评估</a> 开篇那个随机化检验，最初就是冲着梯度显著图来的：研究发现某些（尤其是带「guided」反传规则的）方法，在模型权重被随机打乱后显著图几乎不变，说明它们更像在做边缘检测，而非真正解释模型。这是悬在梯度归因头上的一把剑。</p>\n<p>因此正确的使用纪律是：第一，优先选满足公理的方法（IG），少用已被随机化检验质疑的变体；第二，任何梯度显著图上线前，跑一遍删除/插入曲线与随机化检验把关；第三，明确粒度需求——要语义定位用 Grad-CAM，要细节用 IG，别拿像素级噪点图当最终解释给用户。值得一提的是，<a href=\"shap-shapley\">SHAP</a> 家族里的 DeepSHAP/GradientSHAP 正是把梯度思想与 Shapley 公理结合的产物，可视为梯度归因与博弈论归因的交汇点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>梯度归因利用网络可微性，一次反传即得显著图，计算成本远低于 LIME/SHAP 的采样。</li>\n<li>朴素梯度有三大软肋：饱和、视觉噪声、粒度过细，分别由积分梯度、SmoothGrad、Grad-CAM 应对。</li>\n<li>积分梯度沿基线到输入积分梯度，克服饱和并满足敏感性与实现不变性公理，归因之和等于输出减基线。</li>\n<li>这类方法忠实性争议最大，随机化检验最初就揭穿了部分变体退化为边缘检测，上线前必须评估。</li>\n<li>DeepSHAP/GradientSHAP 把梯度与 Shapley 公理结合，是梯度归因与博弈论归因的交汇。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"梯度归因与显著图","id":"梯度归因与显著图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"朴素梯度：从求导到显著图","id":"朴素梯度-从求导到显著图"},{"level":2,"text":"梯度饱和与积分梯度","id":"梯度饱和与积分梯度"},{"level":2,"text":"降噪与定位：SmoothGrad 与 Grad-CAM","id":"降噪与定位-smoothgrad-与-grad-cam"},{"level":2,"text":"忠实性争议与正确使用","id":"忠实性争议与正确使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SHAP 与 Shapley 值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/feature-attribution/shap-shapley"},"next":{"title":"概念探针与表示分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/model-internals/concept-probing"}}